      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 1910, Austin—now part of Orchard City—boasted fruit sheds, a canning factory, a bank, a drugstore, a pool hall, and even a cement block factory.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
