      ],
      "source": "https://www.orchardcityco.org/index.aspx?nid=26",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A natural carbon dioxide spring southeast of Austin along the river was a key factor that helped the town become a center for produce.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.orchardcityco.org/index.aspx?nid=26",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1912, the three communities of Austin, Cory, and Eckert consolidated to build a water pipeline, leading to Orchard City's incorporation.",
